<title>philippines: Manila foreign exchange market closes for holiday.</title>
<headline>Manila foreign exchange market closes for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>---------------------------May 1 -------------------------</p>
<p>		 * Trading resumes on Friday</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>The Philippine foreign exchange market was closed on Thursday, Labour Day.</p>
<p>Trading will resume on Friday.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, the Philippine peso ended at 26.37 to a dollar after being pounded to a day's low of 26.375 on fears of large outflows from the stockmarket.</p>
<p>MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8936, FAX 817-6267</p>
